{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第63屆金馬獎》今晚（22日）於台北流行音樂中心舉行，電影《告別的年代》入圍第63屆金馬4項大獎並獲選為今年金馬影展開幕片，被視為影后遺珠的女主角宋芸樺，以一襲幾何挖空設計的黑禮服走星光大道，讓人眼睛一亮。</p><p>服裝正面有很多方正的幾何挖空剪裁</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:23:47.208091+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:14:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_hash":"c7f2a2cccd128cf1744c011acda987f8bfbe056449242a111d936ddac79dcb81","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}